---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — LubandArt Tape" description="How LubandArt Tape handles information submitted through this website."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy' }]}>
  <section class="privacy container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 15 September 2026</p>

    <h2>Information we receive</h2>
    <p>When you request a quotation or sample, we may receive your name, company, email address, phone or WhatsApp number, product requirements, specifications, quantity and any information you choose to include in your message. If you email us separately, we may also receive drawings or other attachments.</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use inquiry information only to review your requirements, prepare quotations or samples, respond to your questions, and maintain an internal record of business inquiries. We do not sell inquiry information.</p>

    <h2>Service providers</h2>
    <p>Inquiry data may be processed by the hosting, CRM and email services used to operate this website. These services receive only the information needed to deliver and manage your inquiry.</p>

    <h2>Retention and requests</h2>
    <p>We retain inquiry records only as long as reasonably necessary for business communication, accounting or legal obligations. To request access, correction or deletion of your inquiry information, email <a href="mailto:salestape@lubandart.com">salestape@lubandart.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:salestape@lubandart.com">salestape@lubandart.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy { max-width: 820px; padding-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 5rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .8rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); margin: .5rem 0; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2.2rem; font-size: 1.3rem; }
  p { color: var(--fg-soft); line-height: 1.8; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  .updated { font-size: .85rem; }
</style>
